  "contract": "GET /api/system/external-payload-cleanup and POST /api/system/external-payload-cleanup/pass (published Server 2.11) report and run the namespace's external payload cleanup. A fresh namespace has no expired unclaimed payloads and no recorded pass. Each valid pass reports what it processed, deleted, preserved, skipped and blocked, with its scan limit (default 100, at most 1000), and records a completed pass in the namespace's totals with its whole-second completion time. A limit that is not an integer from 1 to 1000 answers Laravel's 422 without recording a pass; a null or numeric-text limit is accepted. Embedded applications have no HTTP system routes."
